activation	Print prompt	2026-10-21T18:06:52.4773661Z    are the only commands you are allowed to run besides basic file reading.
activation	Print prompt	2026-10-21T18:06:52.4774846Z 2. The issue and all pre-computed facts are in `.triage-context/context.md` (read-only).
